{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45192","headline":"送演上人之抚州觐使君叔 · 皎然","name":"送演上人之抚州觐使君叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临川内史怜诸谢，尔在生缘比惠宗。\n远别应将秦本去，幽寻定有楚僧逢。\n停船夜坐亲孤月，把锡秋行入乱峰。\n便道须过大师寺，白莲池上访高踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}